1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,554
Islom tarixining ilk sahifalarida

2
00:00:03,554 --> 00:00:07,500
jasorati va sadoqati bilan nur sochgan ayollar bor.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,756
Ulardan biri — Asmo binti Abu Bakr roziyallohu anho.

4
00:00:11,756 --> 00:00:14,500
Uning hayoti bugun ham bizga ibratdir.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,554
Uning toʻliq ismi — Asmo binti Abu Bakr as-Siddiq,

6
00:00:19,554 --> 00:00:21,500
kunyasi — Ummu Abdulloh.

7
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:25,184
U Abu Bakr as-Siddiq roziyallohu anhuning qizi,

8
00:00:25,184 --> 00:00:29,000
moʻminlar onasi Oisha roziyallohu anhoning opasi edi.

9
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:33,315
Islomni ilk qabul qilganlardan biri boʻlgan Asmo

10
00:00:33,315 --> 00:00:38,500
sahobiy Zubayr ibn Avvom roziyallohu anhuga turmushga chiqqan.

11
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,783
Hijrat kunlari keldi.

12
00:00:41,783 --> 00:00:44,397
Rasululloh sollallohu alayhi vasallam

13
00:00:44,397 --> 00:00:48,000
va Abu Bakr roziyallohu anhu Madinaga yoʻl oldilar.

14
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,594
Abu Bakrning uyida safar ozuqasi tayyorlandi,

15
00:00:51,594 --> 00:00:55,000
ammo uni va suv meshini bogʻlashga ip topilmadi.

16
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,446
Shunda Asmo oʻz belbogʻini yechdi

17
00:00:58,446 --> 00:01:02,600
va otasining aytishi bilan uni ikkiga boʻldi.

18
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:06,500
Biri bilan ozuqani, ikkinchisi bilan meshni bogʻladi.

19
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:10,586
Shu bois u “Zotun-nitoqayn” — “ikki belbogʻ sohibasi”

20
00:01:10,586 --> 00:01:11,943
nomi bilan tanildi.

21
00:01:11,943 --> 00:01:14,800
Bu voqea “Sahihi Buxoriy”da keltirilgan.

22
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:19,867
Asmo roziyallohu anho Rasulullohdan hadis rivoyat qilgan

23
00:01:19,867 --> 00:01:22,000
sahobiya ayollardan biridir.

24
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:26,359
Rivoyatlari soni manbalarda turlicha keltiriladi.

25
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:30,500
Imom Zahabiy ularni ellik sakkizta deb qayd etgan.

26
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,381
Ulardan oʻn uchtasini Imom Buxoriy va Imom Muslim

27
00:01:34,381 --> 00:01:36,500
birgalikda rivoyat qilganlar.

28
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:41,500
Har bir rivoyatning oʻz sanadi va darajasi bor.

29
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:45,089
Uning rivoyatlarida namoz, poklik, sadaqa

30
00:01:45,089 --> 00:01:49,500
va onaga yaxshilik qilish haqida qimmatli saboqlar bor.

31
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:54,580
Asmo roziyallohu anhoning ilmi avvalo oilasi orqali

32
00:01:54,580 --> 00:01:57,000
keyingi avlodlarga yetib bordi.

33
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:01,866
Oʻgʻillari Abdulloh ibn Zubayr va Urva ibn Zubayr

34
00:02:01,866 --> 00:02:04,600
undan hadis rivoyat qilganlar.

35
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:10,600
Urva keyinchalik Madinaning yetuk faqihlaridan biri boʻldi.

36
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,613
Nevarasi Fotima binti Munzir ham buvisidan hadis rivoyat qilgan;

37
00:02:15,613 --> 00:02:19,000
bu rivoyatlar Hishom ibn Urva orqali tarqalgan.

38
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:23,219
Mashhur tobeʼin Abdulloh ibn Ubaydulloh ibn Abu Mulayka

39
00:02:23,219 --> 00:02:25,000
ham undan rivoyat qilgan.

40
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:30,500
Asmo roziyallohu anhoning hayotidan uch saboq olamiz.

41
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Birinchisi — qiyin damlarda jasorat va xizmat.

42
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:39,800
Ikkinchisi — ilm olish va uni asrashga sadoqat.

43
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:45,000
Uchinchisi — foydali ilmni keyingi avlodlarga yetkazish.

44
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:51,025
Alloh taolo Asmo roziyallohu anhoning hayotlaridan ibrat olishni

45
00:02:51,025 --> 00:02:55,029
va ilmimizga amal qilishni barchamizga nasib etsin.

46
00:02:55,029 --> 00:02:55,500
Omiyn.

47
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:59,500
Ilm — omonat. Uni asrash va yetkazish — mas’uliyat.

